{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"aea65afe0e5862ee36486d1d8f71c20a1bc4c3aa5415828aa0c58b4c80057d03","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["劝以色列人悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听我为你们唱哀歌：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“少女以色列跌倒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也站不起来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她被遗弃在自己的土地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人扶她起来。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“以色列家的城邑中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出兵一千的，只有百人生还；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出兵一百的，只有十人生还。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和华对以色列家说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们要寻求我，才能存活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要去伯特利求问，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要进入吉甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要前往别示巴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为吉甲人必被掳去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伯特利也必化为乌有。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要寻求耶和华，才能存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"否则，祂要在约瑟家","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"如烈火爆发，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬伯特利，无人能扑灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这些使正义变为苦艾、将公义丢弃在地的人啊，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那位造昴星和参星、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使幽暗变为黎明、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使白昼变为黑夜、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召来海水浇在大地上的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的名字是耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使毁灭如闪电临到强者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毁他们的坚城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你们憎恨在城门口主持公道的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"厌恶说话正直的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们践踏穷人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对他们横征暴敛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你们用凿过的石头建房，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不得居住在里面；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们栽种佳美的葡萄园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却喝不到葡萄酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道你们的过犯累累、罪恶无数。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们迫害义人，收受贿赂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在城门口冤枉穷人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是邪恶的时代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以明智者静默不言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要弃恶从善，才能存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，万军之上帝耶和华必与你们同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如你们所说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要恨恶邪恶，喜爱良善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在城门口伸张正义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也许万军之上帝耶和华会恩待约瑟的余民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"因此，主——万军之上帝耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“哀号之声要响遍各广场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭喊之声将充满大街小巷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"农夫被叫来哭泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭丧者被召来哀号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每个葡萄园都传出哀号声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我要从你们中间经过。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"盼望耶和华的日子到来的人有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们为什么盼望耶和华的日子呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日将带来黑暗，而非光明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的光景将好像人逃避狮子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却遇上了熊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃回家里，手扶墙壁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又被蛇咬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的日子将充满黑暗，毫无光明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一片漆黑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫无亮光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"“我憎恶、鄙弃你们的节期，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"厌恶你们的圣会。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你们献上燔祭和素祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不悦纳；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你们用肥美的牲畜献上平安祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不屑一顾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"消除你们嘈杂的歌声吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不想听到你们的琴音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯愿公正如江河滔滔不尽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公义如溪流绵绵不绝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在旷野的四十年间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们向我献过祭物和供物吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们抬着为自己造的神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你们的王撒固和星神迦温。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要把你们流放到比大马士革还远的地方。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的，祂的名字是万军之上帝。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"“约瑟家”此处指约瑟的子孙以法莲和玛拿西两个支派，圣经中有时用约瑟家代指北国以色列。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}